    {
      "id": 49,
      "msgctxt": "506128",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I think.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "msgctxt": "506488",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Hey there! #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!\nDon't just walk up to me so casually!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "msgctxt": "506904",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Still…… Tsukumihara may be lax with its dress code,\nbut does her outfit even pass as a uniform…?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "msgctxt": "507436",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Because I know her better than that.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "msgctxt": "507484",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Her name is #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "msgctxt": "507620",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "When she's quiet, she seems like quite the refined lady,\nbut that's ruined by her headstrong and unrestrained personality,\ncoming off as a tomboy when she opens her mouth.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "msgctxt": "507808",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "……no. In my case, should I say it's a blessing?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "msgctxt": "507860",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I don't know how many times\nher activeness and positivity have helped me.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "msgctxt": "508640",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "\"……hm?\nWhy am I even picking a fight with #[him][her]#?\"",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "msgctxt": "508704",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "she said, as she tilted her head.",
      "pt": ""
    },
