      "pt": "sem salvar os Clear Data?"
    },
    {
      "id": 90,
      "msgctxt": "510376",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "This is the chapel.\nThe door is firmly shut,\nand there's no sign of anyone inside.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 91,
      "msgctxt": "510460",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I've been in here once\nsince I first came to this school――",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 92,
      "msgctxt": "510524",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "The flowers are blooming in all varieties of colors,\nas if in competition with one another.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 93,
      "msgctxt": "510616",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I've heard that the flowerbeds get switched out\naccording to season, but I've never heard\nwho it was that takes care of that.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 94,
      "msgctxt": "510744",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "How many times have I told you\nthat you can't do that like we're friends?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 95,
      "msgctxt": "510820",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "She started yelling at me before I even opened my mouth.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 96,
      "msgctxt": "510880",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Through the pressure, I took a second glance at her.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 97,
      "msgctxt": "510936",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "To put it simply, she was a flashy girl.\nShe had neat black leather boots,\nand clothes that really showed off her body lines.\nIt gave her an overall impression of tightness.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 98,
      "msgctxt": "511112",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "What, you're staring at me like I'm unusual.\nIt hasn't been that long, you know?\nWe had lunch together just yesterday too.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 99,
      "msgctxt": "511236",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Well, you've always been this rude, though.\nEven when we first met, staring at my face wit―\nHey, are you checking out my legs――!?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "msgctxt": "511372",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Y-you've got no shame programmed in your head.\nI'm not saying DON'T look, but if you will,\nthen you better cough up some money, MONEY!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "msgctxt": "511508",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "The girl seems to be on the verge of grabbing me by force.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "msgctxt": "511568",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Even though she's feeling so embarrassed\nthat she's about to resort to violence, I don't panic.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "msgctxt": "511664",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "She's one of the most popular girls in this school\nand its highest-scoring honor student.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 104,
      "msgctxt": "511756",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "…you know, I said you were getting too close.\nBottom line is #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF and I are enemies.\nIt'll only be trouble if we get too familiar.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 105,
      "msgctxt": "511908",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Give me a break.\nSure, we briefly fought side-by-side,\nbut that's no reason to be so trusting.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 106,
      "msgctxt": "512004",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "……enemies…… fighting together……",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 107,
      "msgctxt": "512044",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "#C236196003Rin#CDEF used an interesting choice of words.\nOur tests scores aren't comparable,\nand we don't have any club activities to compete over,\nso there's nothing to fight about……",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 108,
      "msgctxt": "512232",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Anyway, isn't it time for the show to start?\nI've got my hands full myself, so I'll let you\noff the hook for this little chat.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 109,
      "msgctxt": "512360",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "See ya, then.\nIf fate would have it, let's meet again.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 110,
      "msgctxt": "512416",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "……actually, you BETTER keep winning\nuntil we meet again. I'm holding you to it!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 111,
      "msgctxt": "512500",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "In her usual manner,\n#C236196003Rin#CDEF's hair swayed as she walked past.\nAlong the way,",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 112,
      "msgctxt": "512592",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 2,
      "en": "……I become dizzy. Maybe it's the setting sun in my eyes.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 113,
      "msgctxt": "512652",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 2,
      "en": "Come to think of it……\nI feel like I was talking to someone just now.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 114,
      "msgctxt": "512724",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Must be my imagination.\nProbably just my imagination.\nI must be really tired is all―――",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 115,
      "msgctxt": "512816",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "My head starts to clear up.\n……I should head for the #C000246204shoe lockers#CDEF now.",
      "pt": ""
    }
  ]
}
